* Function Breakdown

This is where I break the features in functions


1. Playing vs a computer (MVP)
functions;
	randomPick(); | assign a random move| input = none | output = A random Pick
	user1Pick(); | update the user move | Input = eventlistener | output = user1's Pick
	user2Pick(); | update the Bot a move | randomPick(); | output = user2's Pick
	gameLogic();| update the winner and loser| input = user1Pick , user2Pick | output= none
displayUi();| update the UI with with new information| input = user1,user2, scoreboard)

2. keeping score of between games and clear score
function;
	updateScoreboard();| update the scoreboad| input = winner| output = none
	clearScore();| reset the scoreboard | input(ClearButton)|ouput = none

3. score being kept on local Storage
functions;
	saveScore(); | save the score of the game| input = the score| output = none
	displayScore(); | pull the score from locoal storage| input = none| output = the score


